      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST BELIEVE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing eighth (23.10) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including nine wins. Ready to return to form. WESTSIDE WIZARD (6) goes very well at the course and distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. Placed last time (22.39) at Warrnambool in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 3.5 lengths. Looks well placed here and among the chances. PAW RAMELLO (8) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (20.23) over 350m at Traralgon. Well placed here and should do much better. FRED'S FURY (4) racing over this distance brings the best out in him.",
